{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0075","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000000ed:text","row":17243,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"原稿を書いている。","en":"I was working on my manuscript.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003772","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00001","en":"Writing the script.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000011f:text","row":17244,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ひっひっひ」","en":"“Heh heh heh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003773","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Hihihi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000014d:text","row":17245,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「ひっひっひっひっひ！」","en":"“Heh heh heh heh heh!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003774","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Hihihihihi!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000185:text","row":17246,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「ひーっひっひっひっひっひ！！（泣いている）」","en":"“Heeeh heh heh heh heh heh!!” (I was crying.)","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003775","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00004","en":"Taichi: \"Hiii hih hih hih hih hiii!!! (crying)\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000001cb:text","row":17247,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"まとまらないよー！","en":"It just wouldn’t come together!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003776","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00005","en":"It won't take shaaape!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000001f5:text","row":17248,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"初日、自分の才能にうっとりしながら書いていた頃とはテンションが正反対だ。","en":"The mood was the exact opposite of day one, when I’d been writing drunk on my own talent.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003777","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00006","en":"This is the exact opposite spirit of that first day, when I wrote while spellbound by my own talent.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000278:text","row":17249,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……けーくーんー……」","en":"“...Eeeex...”","speakerJa":"女","speakerEn":"Woman","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003778","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00007","en":"Voice: \"...keee-kuuun...!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000002a8:text","row":17250,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"誰かが呼んでる。","en":"Someone was calling me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003779","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00008","en":"Someone is calling me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000003a1:text","row":17251,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から外をのぞく。","en":"I peered out the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003780","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00009","en":"I peek outside from the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000003d3:text","row":17252,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「みみ先輩？」","en":"“Mimi?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003781","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Mimi-senpai?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000430:text","row":17253,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんばんはー」","en":"“Good eveniiiing!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003782","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00011","en":"Misato: \"Good eveniiing!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000460:text","row":17254,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしたんですかー？」","en":"“What brings you heeere?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003783","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00012","en":"Taichi: \"What brings youuu?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The source asks what happened or what brought her there. “What brings you” lacks the complement “here.”","remedy":"Use “What brings you here?”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"What brings youuu?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000004b5:text","row":17255,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「どこにいるのですー？」","en":"“Where are yooou?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003784","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Where are youuu?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000004ed:text","row":17256,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「二階の窓からそっち見てますー」","en":"“I’m looking at you from the second-floor windooow!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003785","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Looking at you from the second floor windooow!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000054a:text","row":17257,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「暗くて見えませーん」","en":"“It’s too dark to see yooou!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003786","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00015","en":"Misato: \"It's too dark I cannot seee!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The two independent parts require coordination or punctuation: “It’s too dark; I can’t see.”","remedy":"Use “It’s too dark—I can’t see!”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"It's too dark I cannot seee!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000580:text","row":17258,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「こっちはよく見えますよー」","en":"“I can see you just fiiine!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003787","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00016","en":"Taichi: \"I can see you well from heeere!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000005d9:text","row":17259,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしてなんでしょうねー」","en":"“Why do you suppose thaaat is?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003788","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00017","en":"Misato: \"How is that possibleee!\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000615:text","row":17260,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「さー？」","en":"“Who knooows?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003789","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Who knooows?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000065c:text","row":17261,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくんはすごく夜目がきくんですねー」","en":"“X, you have amazing night visiooon.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003790","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00019","en":"Misato: \"You got amazing night vision, Peke-kuuun!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000006a4:text","row":17262,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「野生どーぶつなんで感覚鋭いんですよー」","en":"“I’m a wild animaaal, so I’ve got keen senses!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003791","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00020","en":"Taichi: \"I got sharp senses 'cause I'm wild animaaal!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar"],"assessment":"The singular count noun “animal” requires an article after “I’m.”","remedy":"Use “I’ve got sharp senses because I’m a wild animal!”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":54,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"I got sharp senses 'cause I'm wild animaaal!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000709:text","row":17263,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんかかっこいいですー」","en":"“That’s kind of cooool.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003792","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00021","en":"Misato: \"That is pretty coool!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000073b:text","row":17264,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"話しながらばたばたと腕を振っている。","en":"She flapped both arms as she called up to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003793","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00022","en":"She flaps and swings her arms around while she talks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000777:text","row":17265,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"あれでけっこう幼いのだ。","en":"She could be surprisingly childlike.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003794","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00023","en":"That's pretty childish of her.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The source observes that despite appearances she is rather childlike. “That’s childish of her” judges only the immediately preceding arm motion.","remedy":"Use “For all that, she’s actually quite childlike.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":30,"start":0,"text":"That's pretty childish of her."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000007af:text","row":17266,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「それより、あがってくださいー」","en":"“Anyway, come on uuup.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003795","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Anyway, please come insiiide!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000080c:text","row":17267,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「はーいー」","en":"“Okaaay.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003796","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00025","en":"Misato: \"YEEE-ES!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000097c:text","row":17268,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、蝋燭♪」","en":"“Oh, a candle♪”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003797","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00026","en":"Misato: \"Ah, a candle!♪\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000009aa:text","row":17269,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「執筆活動には雰囲気が大切なんですよ、おぜうさん」","en":"“Atmosphere is everything to a working writer, little miss.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003798","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Atmosphere is important to the act of Writing, my lady.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source jokingly says atmosphere matters to writing. Capitalizing the common noun in “the act of Writing” is unsupported and overformalizes the phrase.","remedy":"Use “Atmosphere is important when one writes, my lady.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":65,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Atmosphere is important to the act of Writing, my lady.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000a7a:text","row":17270,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「なるほどー」","en":"“Ah, I seee.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003799","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00028","en":"Misato: \"I see!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000aa0:text","row":17271,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょこんと正座。","en":"She settled primly onto her heels.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003800","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00029","en":"She goes into seiza with a quiet puff.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The source says she settles neatly and compactly into seiza. “With a quiet puff” invents a sound and misses the small, composed posture.","remedy":"Use “She settled neatly into seiza.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":0,"text":"She goes into seiza with a quiet puff."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000b4e:text","row":17272,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「お勉強でもしてたんですか？」","en":"“Were you studying?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003801","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00030","en":"Misato: \"Were you doing your studies?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000b8c:text","row":17273,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、原稿です」","en":"“No. A manuscript.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003802","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00031","en":"Taichi: \"No, the script.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000bdb:text","row":17274,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ」","en":"“Ah.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003803","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00032","en":"Misato: \"Ahhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000c03:text","row":17275,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「して、当家にはどのような御用向きで？」","en":"“And what business brings you to my humble abode?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003804","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Then, what might be the business at hand that brought you towards this domicile, ma'am?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000cc9:text","row":17276,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、よく手伝ってくれてますから、ご飯をオゴろうかと思いまして」","en":"“You’ve been helping me so much that I thought I’d treat you to dinner.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003805","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00034","en":"Misato: \"Ah, because you have been so good at helping me, I thought I would give you a treat to eat.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"assessment":"She says he has helped her often and she thought she would treat him to a meal. “Good at helping me” changes frequency to skill, and “give you a treat to eat” is malformed.","remedy":"Use “You’ve helped me so often that I thought I’d treat you to dinner.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":101,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"Ah, because you have been so good at helping me, I thought I would give you a treat to eat.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000d21:text","row":17277,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"包みを掲げた。","en":"She held up a bundle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003806","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00035","en":"She produced a package.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["omission","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source says she holds the package up for him to see. “Produced” only means brought it out and omits the display gesture.","remedy":"Use “She held up a package.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":23,"start":0,"text":"She produced a package."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000dcd:text","row":17278,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「お弁当です」","en":"“I brought dinner.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003807","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00036","en":"Misato: \"It is a bento.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000dfb:text","row":17279,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩万歳」","en":"“All hail Miyasumi.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003808","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00037","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai banzai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000e44:text","row":17280,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「二人分作ってきたんです、一緒にどうですか？」","en":"“I made enough for two. Would you like to eat together?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003809","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00038","en":"Misato: \"I made enough for two. Is together fine?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The source asks whether he would like to eat the two portions together with her. “Is together fine?” has no subject or action.","remedy":"Use “I made enough for two. Would you like to eat together?”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":50,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"I made enough for two. Is together fine?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00000e92:text","row":17281,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「飲み物持ってきます」","en":"“I’ll get us something to drink.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003810","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00039","en":"Taichi: \"I will bring something to drink.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001052:text","row":17282,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「うまい」","en":"“This is really good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003811","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00040","en":"Taichi: \"Delicious!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000107c:text","row":17283,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩は器用だなあ」","en":"“You’re really good at this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003812","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00041","en":"Taichi: \"You are really skilled at this Senpai!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","grammar"],"assessment":"The direct address “Senpai” must be set off with a comma; without it, the object of “this” runs into the addressee.","remedy":"Use “You’re really skilled at this, Senpai.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":48,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"You are really skilled at this Senpai!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000112e:text","row":17284,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうですか？　料理は最近はじめたばかりなんですけど……」","en":"“Am I? I only just started cooking...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003813","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00042","en":"Misato: \"Am I now? But I only really started to cook recently...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001188:text","row":17285,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「まー、俺もグルメじゃないんで」","en":"“Well, I’m not exactly a gourmet.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003814","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00043","en":"Taichi: \"Well, I am not exactly a gourmet.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001246:text","row":17286,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、その言い方はひどいかもです……」","en":"“Ouch. That might’ve been a little mean...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003815","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00044","en":"Misato: \"Aw, that is really a mean way to put it...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:0000128c:text","row":17287,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、うまいですよ。うん、うまい」","en":"“No, really, it’s good. Yeah. Really good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003816","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00045","en":"Taichi: \"Ahhh, but it is delicious! Yes, delicious!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000012d0:text","row":17288,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「火の通り方がいいですね。直火ですか？」","en":"“It’s cooked perfectly. Over an open flame?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003817","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00046","en":"Taichi: \"They have been well cooked. Was it open flame?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001396:text","row":17289,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい。もちろん」","en":"“Yes. Of course.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003818","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00047","en":"Misato: \"Yes. Of course.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000013c8:text","row":17290,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なんか、こういう弁当食べるの、久しぶり」","en":"“...It’s been a long time since I had a homemade meal like this.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003819","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00048","en":"Taichi: \"...really, eating a bento like this, it's been so long.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001494:text","row":17291,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうなんですか？」","en":"“Really?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003820","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00049","en":"Misato: \"Was it really?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The source asks whether that is presently so. “Was it really?” incorrectly places the situation in the past.","remedy":"Use “Is that so?”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"Was it really?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000014c8:text","row":17292,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺……母親、いないですから」","en":"“I... don’t have a mother.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003821","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00050","en":"Taichi: \"Me... my mother is not with us, that is why.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["overinterpretation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source says he does not have a mother, without specifying death. “Not with us” conventionally implies that she died and narrows the absence.","remedy":"Use “I... don’t have a mother.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":54,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Me... my mother is not with us, that is why.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001584:text","row":17293,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ……」","en":"“Oh...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003822","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00051","en":"Misato: \"Well...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000015b0:text","row":17294,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「母親が恋しいのかもしれませんね、俺」","en":"“Maybe I miss having a mother.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003823","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00052","en":"Taichi: \"Maybe I just miss her, my mother.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001674:text","row":17295,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぺけくん」","en":"“X.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003824","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00053","en":"Misato: \"Peke-kun.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000016a0:text","row":17296,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩」","en":"“Miyasumi.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003825","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00054","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000016c0:text","row":17297,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"薄闇の中、見つめ合う。","en":"We gazed at each other in the half-light.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003826","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00055","en":"Gazes meet inside this faintest of lights.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","word_choice"],"assessment":"The source says the two look into each other’s eyes in the dimness. “Gazes meet” removes the people as agents, and “faintest of lights” changes dim darkness into light sources.","remedy":"Use “We gazed at each other in the dimness.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":42,"start":0,"text":"Gazes meet inside this faintest of lights."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:000016ee:text","row":17298,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"蝋燭のあえかな炎が、彼女の頬を淡い朱色に照らした。","en":"The candle’s tiny flame brushed her cheek with pale crimson.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:003827","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0024:00056","en":"The delicate flame of the candle shone a pale vermilion on the girl's cheeks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001760:choice:01","row":17299,"ordinal":57,"kind":"choice","jp":"迫る","en":"Make a move","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0075:00001760:choice:02","row":17300,"ordinal":58,"kind":"choice","jp":"ボケる","en":"Crack a joke","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
